// HackTool - WinPwn Execution - ScriptBlock | T1046, T1082, T1106, T1518, T1548.002, T1552.001, T1555, T1555.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_hktl_winpwn.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where powershell.file.script_block_text like "*Offline_Winpwn*" or powershell.file.script_block_text like "*WinPwn *" or powershell.file.script_block_text like "*WinPwn.exe*" or powershell.file.script_block_text like "*WinPwn.ps1*"
